        "TileImage": "$($repository 9571d196-8d67-4d94-8dad-6e2d970d7a91).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening,  47.\r\rWe have found two of the partners and three operatives that helped Carlisle escape the Sceptre. We only have a short window to chase after Carlisle, so try to finish this quick. \r\rI have some ideas for how you can kill the targets, so the remaining operatives will be too confused on what just happened to follow you out.\r\rLucky hunt, 47.",
